# BlueBloodBasketball's generated static assets — rebuilt from tracked sources by
# scripts/basketball/build-site-assets.mjs on every `npm run build:bb` (and in CI), so
# they aren't tracked. sites/basketball/public/data/ IS tracked (built by `build:data:bb`).
